"id": "b45e69d", "blocks": [{"type": "columns", "cols": [{"width": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "<h4>Audi Q5 Decals</h4> <p>Owning a business means thinking of contemporary ways to create an impression and stand out.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.iblegal.ca/\">Indigoblue Legal Professional Corporation</a> realized the potential of advertising via car wraps and decals and wanted to brand their Audi Q5. It is a provider of alternative investments, private mortgages, real estate, and estate planning. Most importantly, they have been socially responsible in giving back to our community since inception, with a key emphasis on raising funds for Autism Awareness.</p> <p>They wanted minimal branding on their Audi Q5 but wanted it to stand out on the road. They wanted decals on their car hood with their brand logo, website QR Code, and their prime offers. Our design team understood their requirement and created a mockup. After the design was approved, it was printed using high-quality waterproof ink. The next step involves weeding to pry out the excess vinyl. Once the vinyl is weeded out, it’s covered with high-quality transfer 3M masking tape. Finally, our installer applied the vinyl decals, and here is the final result.</p> <figure> <img alt=\"Indigo Blue Audi Q5 Decals - After Wrap - Vinyl Wrap Toronto\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Indigo-Blue-Audi-Q5-Decals-After-Wrap-Vinyl-Wrap-Toronto.jpg\"/> <figcaption>Indigo Blue Audi Q5 Decals – After Wrap – Vinyl Wrap Toronto</figcaption></figure> <p>If you are a business and want to advertise your vehicle wrap, Vinyl Wrap Toronto is your go-to car wrap shop. Not only that, but we also specialize in signage and equipment wraps. To know the car wrap price, feel free to call us at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a> or you can also <a href=\"/contact/\">fill out the form</a> and our experts will get back to you. You can also visit us at <a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">24 Ronson Dr, Unit 1, Etobicoke, ON, M9W1B4</a><a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">.</a></p> <p>Check out other car wraps:</p> <p><a href=\"/audi-a5-decals-vinyl-stickers-avery/\">Audi A5 Delux Auto 2012 Decals</a></p> <p><a href=\"/audi-a4-sand-wrap-vinyl-wrap-toronto/\">Audi A4 2006 – Full Car Wrap</a></p> <p>To stay updated, follow us on social.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Facebook</a> | <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Instagram</a> | <a href=\"https://twitter.com/vinylwraptdot\">Twitter</a> | <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/vinyl-wrap-toronto-469489186/\">LinkedIn </a>| <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.ca/vinylwrapstoronto/_saved/\">Pinterest</a></p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/creative-integrity-ford-f150-car-graphics/", "text": "Prev Previous Car Graphics on Creative Integrity’s Ford F-150 – Best Custom Decals in Toronto"}, "next": {"href": "/quality-promotional-pickup-truck-decals-gta/", "text": "Next Commercial Pickup Truck Decals and Lettering Next"}}]}, {"width": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Limited Time Offer", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-size:22px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get a Standard 3M or Avery Manufactured Full Wrap for a Tesla at", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4em;color:var( --e-global-color-a8178e9 );font-weight:500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "$4,500 $3,500", "href": null, "style": null}, {"type": "button", "text": "Claim Now", "href": "#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjIyMDU1IiwidG9nZ2xlIjpmYWxzZX0%3D", "style": "text-align:center;font-size:14px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase"}, {"type": "toc", "title": "Table of Contents"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text